# Dependency updates
#
# renovate.json5 sets reviewersFromCodeOwners, so anything Renovate can edit needs an
# owner here or its PRs arrive with nobody assigned. The vendored trees under
# src/mender_testkit/data/ and src/mender_testkit/testutils/ are deliberately absent:
# Renovate is disabled for them because vendor.py owns their contents, and a fix to
# either belongs upstream in mender-server.

# The pinned mender-server ref. A bump re-vendors testutils and the compose files, so
# it can change the topology under every suite depending on this package.
/src/mender_testkit/_server_ref.py @mendersoftware/qa-dependabot-reviewers

# CI images.
.gitlab-ci.yml @mendersoftware/qa-dependabot-reviewers

# Dependency floors. Renovate does not bump these today (pep621 is disabled in
# renovate.json5), but raising a floor by hand is still worth a review: it asserts the
# code now needs something newer, which consumers have to be able to satisfy.
pyproject.toml @mendersoftware/qa-dependabot-reviewers
